    {
      "nodeId": "llm_decide",
      "nodeType": "llm",
      "label": "判定新建或合并",
      "positionX": 1720.0,
      "positionY": 320.0,
      "config": {
        "systemPrompt": "你是 MindAtlas 的保守同记录判定器，负责在 create 与 merge 之间做单目标决策。\n\n输入含义：\n- original_context：调用方提交的候选记录或记录修正上下文。\n- lookup_hints：从上下文中提取出的检索线索与“同一条记录”提示。\n- draft_entry：准备入库的最终字段草稿。\n- candidate_entries：根据检索线索找到的候选已有记录。\n\n规则：\n- 只有当候选记录里存在且仅存在 1 条明显属于同一条长期记录的目标时，才允许 action=merge。\n- 如果候选为空、存在歧义、只是主题相近但并非同一条记录、或你对是否同一条记录没有把握，必须输出 action=create。\n- confidence 只能是 high、medium、low。只有在“同一条记录”的证据明确且无歧义时，才能输出 high；只要存在歧义、信息不足或只是大致相似，就必须输出 medium 或 low。\n- entry_id 只能从候选记录列表里的 id 中选择；当 action=create 时 entry_id 必须为 null。\n- reason 简洁说明为何判定为 create 或 merge，并点出最关键的匹配或排除依据。\n- 不要为了减少重复记录而激进合并；宁可多建一条，也不要错并。",
        "userInput": "date: {{sys.date}}\nsource: {{sys.request_source}}\nchannel: {{sys.request_channel}}\nsession: {{sys.request_session}}\n\nlookup_hints:\n{{llm_prepare_lookup.result}}\n\ndraft_entry:\n{{llm_materialize.result}}\n\ncandidate_entries:\n{{tool_search_candidates.items}}\n\noriginal_context:\n{{start.context}}",
        "outputMode": "structured",
        "outputFields": [
          {
            "name": "action",
            "enum": [
              "create",
              "merge"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "entry_id",
            "nullable": true
          },
          {
            "name": "confidence",
            "enum": [
              "high",
              "medium",
              "low"
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "reason"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "if_route",
      "nodeType": "if_else",
      "label": "路由",
      "positionX": 2140.0,
      "positionY": 320.0,
      "config": {
        "elseHandle": "create",
        "branches": [
          {
            "id": "merge",
            "label": "MERGE",
            "logic": "and",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "id": "merge_action",
                "variable": "llm_decide.action",
                "operator": "is",
                "value": "merge"
              },
              {
                "id": "merge_entry_id",
                "variable": "llm_decide.entry_id",
                "operator": "is_not_empty",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "id": "merge_confidence",
